{"id":"34536883","title":"如梦似幻，华农下雪了！ | 今日小雪","published_at":"2026-11-22T08:06:00+08:00","published_label":"2026-11-22","cover":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCoZIrwHO9RVjAKr3YWnawM7KKrL37licbzzATgT9ju9tXdq26yryYhia5YGAI1ke7UXYSnfdkEChuXT42y9jYt7UBwSf5ZaGMS4/0?wx_fmt=jpeg","summary":"华农二十四节气 【编者按】风携冬意入南野，节近小雪草木柔。小雪，是冬季的第二个节气，此时北方寒潮南下、初雪纷飞，而刚刚入秋的广州只是微露清寒。华农校园里，异木棉","tags":["校园"],"source":"wechat","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ihMrZ2CsV42uE9KbYoIExQ","paper_url":"https://m.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_34536883","word_count":1982,"fetched_at":"2026-11-23T06:37:21+08:00","content_html":"<div><section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=4480476665726320640#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBicY88pllxCbdDjzjnIfvmJk7HmhZh32NXmvSlLVKlMraV4DZxiazLY7ibqRmLlticwl9YLKzm6Iic19Sq9EVpUPN1dsMVaRPbibmhE/640?from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/f0Y88BS1DUBKSXuF28UmjryTpLYkcGibatyy3PlvClOZLIORUicgd7lbUEMibpAoEialSguYTKb96sHsu08FDuiaGaAwSKdxyBUj3l0ov1pUkvJY/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>华农二十四节气</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>【编者按】风携冬意入南野，节近小雪草木柔。小雪，是冬季的第二个节气，此时北方寒潮南下、初雪纷飞，而刚刚入秋的广州只是微露清寒。</span><span>华农校园里，异木棉、丹桂盛开，不少草木开始换上金装。</span></p><p><span>对于大部分岭南人而言，雪是一个期盼已久却未能亲临的愿望。今天，跟随《华农二十四节气》专题，看AI模拟雪景的如梦似幻，共赏真实岭南光景。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckD06EBpmUIOy6227GrNk4rxfFXaCb0W6mTlPQaHuGDHiaRwJ3iaFZ43KDoCQpuZSurefhg5qUWJCgDraTGJJQGTyGklRxPshEH6c/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAsevx7UJE1p14PHJ1UiaCB09BVEXH5Od9cQ0OkrZDOjkPkdBcLACORvjVwECaGdFt3Ue7G0ROlZhenySMGpSZ5bheibDOiaSdh0Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>点击视频，走进华农小雪</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_gif/IDUdWG9uScADeriaKXThK0ibT0Hlb99XsrbachMIPya41fxpLWaVzUwAhPCnOXmsXBx3icoibKjZiayleX9TG9e4wCWiaNibmBtAkZo4Az4hBeDPqg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>算法落雪处，皆是温柔乡</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>想象有一天</span></p><p><span>你从睡梦中醒来</span></p><p><span>看见一个银装素裹的华农</span></p><p><span>那会是怎样的场景？</span></p><p><span>一夜之间</span></p><p><span>一切都变得熟悉又新奇</span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCtk6zVx25U0o1bsdX79IIYCB0MXh4qWcME0CdHQgz3kmEzfJ4pichGtNsyCxono5lzqjJhwuhguLFlUJhxpATP07pkvzB00JcY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckD0CGqLibqLC86qHBSYyP