29Pw91EicWRPZs166k6Q7icHsR14ciczsHTF7ytI7yGSIJAYBQUvgDJUSVRibYcLCeoF2onZ4Lxc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCQWbLJgcwVicZt3HgUFVt1icibCWJUCRdiatHnD8XsKQayswofzwL7mJ3soBFxHoiaMHZSOxoH7jyQXSdjMwwKu5Fv8Kuuvgib2Yg9s/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>穿梭其中</span></span></p><p><span><span>不禁伸手接住一片雪花</span></span></p><p><span><span>教四的钟楼愈发素净</span></span></p><p><span><span>那一串深浅不一的足迹</span></span></p><p><span><span>显得格外宁静</span></span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAFZ1SDjK5p6RjIvib0eS7JrPaPgMIVsEtIKYwiaokWTVdHwjwvWTAxv4IkU16tb4gtfUjXNlmtFVUrnoxT1HvKdsfbmI6lEkPYc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBGI7OJqQ7oL2z1YvWicgN75b1erocWRBwK8Zppu9pp1qRvrNr3pEpdlqic9VpamL4NSOKRxgXFlUCeicq0XmFY50XvTm515v2aRc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDJzHwicLy6lWWMZuXzYibuC6OibgEoEc42EeNwncCGhWQykRYIN6Buomg0C4JOZMXUUha2SJQqarT7Qwz2SS1xiarG5kloor9gBVQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckB4vLL5gHMNvjU3hnfpg6QE5IIFcbERI9hBfV4SGRZLK9JVLNrrZ2WMibgvttQbSv6SgP3GZUkCju8I69LiaiaUzEuW5jtiaFnIOtQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAibpxk5c4aiaUicse3fAQCg0P2hS0mCGO15paRmPibwoxcsh460j5GbFZNGd2eWL87MKPjlRfPhwmwZ9UfMdKZsBcgHzRrsZVjKus/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>水中嬉戏的游鸭</span></p><p><span>轻轻抖去身上的寒气</span></p><p><span>孙中山先生像的书页上</span></p><p><span>也有不少顽皮的雪花停留</span></p><p><span>红满堂前、校史馆边、洪泽湖畔</span></p><p><span>昔日熟悉的一切换上新装</span></p><p><span>走在嘎吱作响的雪地</span></p><p><span>真希望时间再慢一些</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAM6kKCa2TeKS7nQeHfIHcrvnTNjcmEqtfdgndQYCKA4uACqrkm6SjJFRIOlWApzPFN0hLI2iaLtwDDgQzgoNvw3ndaQDC1jrGQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBBLQCp9jqzASG2iaBkK18WFo0b3bFtXjngynvRDL0cW7ZWKXGA6xprTeUg37Kf9MwX6R2tT330MLPpCamia0t8sLnO1AibPcVfAA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCsGs3ibAhP05nIyVE21JlvYwU1IFOf82KkE7SccibeSUraf7XBkUfSCT62gvnEiazmR9HibwiaKlFKSviciajj6sZMWHkv8V1CC9abX0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckA4ZmemUQ3KERjc03B63FV8n8ZhiaQOYcxsLv3nTevHqFBibhNZMCQ2wo5OYNCeq4BjTBjichfrEN8PMz5NDB7kA8vqKngmQCV4q4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><p><span>AI模拟的雪景</span></p><p><span>如梦似幻，美不胜收</span></p><p><span>而真实的华农校园</span></p><p><span>正上演着入秋的温柔</span></p><p><span>跟随官微的镜头</span></p><p><span>探寻时令留给我们的惊喜</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_gif/IDUdWG9uScADeriaKXThK0ibT0Hlb99XsrbachMIPya41fxpLWaVzUwAhPCnOXmsXBx3icoibKjZiayleX9TG9e4wCWiaNibmBtAkZo4Az4hBeDPqg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>虹藏天净时，万物正交接</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>小雪分三候，一候虹藏不见，二候天气上升、地气下降，三候闭塞而成冬。小雪后通常气温转凉、降水变少，阳气上升、阴气下沉。草木生长渐缓，天地间生机趋于收敛，万物都在完成一次安静的交接。</span></p><p><span>南国的秋天来得晚而温柔，前不久广州才官宣“入秋”，温度随之而降。</span><span>草木感知时节的速度，往往比人们测算得快一步。</span><span>校园内不少树木已经变色，常青与金红交织，花开与叶落共存。</span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDnakdPoc8Ao8PSk391wEbvicjrxTPDEnh3PxUs7UWBUTQUM5Wygiczh12miadgtQ87s2Bufg261Xq0hibe8ScYpNBpfOliaZY9Cjbk/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBJLK4Yrk3HIg8e8VNvBHXKdktXliaHlibPyjpRsrCENv2JOPa1otfbp8RmPib6wGGBARbbqibPKgI30PYTgUcWt0OL2lHsTafFQNw/640?from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>大花紫薇</span></span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCGpIUmJDlAPnH3TWibiaAIezMC8N7hNCjgSicE1rz62zmvb0AcJyu8LfLwQ7Pic1EM7ibhy6gzePD7sp2yMujLD5aY27uCm7iaSCqX8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBycEicr6PZJj4ibeYMN534iarnibWsPvAtfD4MFxf3CWddkojibYHZ3r4SJfFGjsxnxUfKNMA6PxJxzTlaPRTZic7icYnzeW8v6NgZ14/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>落羽杉</span></p></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDa55pr3FwuoIibB7y7qJmMJj39viap7UTSHfxz78dic52icWTwiafkDXNZ3ayLncrQic3pib20E4uVaPvLWGKwibtDnvwjePLpY7Jic9jY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>大花紫薇叶</span></p><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAVWxkALCnVACniaom0YeQW9qArk4ghxrgW2QOwggsdrIERItAib4Gxnwo4Say9GV5e678RCliauhv751NSK8fMOibVAcs0LBo03t0/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span>山乌桕</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAwyIibiaFPSpaXQZ1lMjV3jZcK1h9ibw5eccMz8V1sG4ZM9hVYaE2dkzfYxygu7GLibpd3Fe5ZqjHZKCuovTich4PCEIWYKU8sKUao/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>铁冬青</span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckA5A1oRibdfzlB5cfQN5c4nF4OF5r7EMibDPic3l2fKcRuOXdZbsricBeghHztOK6iaUooTQtzTKCTZtFf2HgJPFQJxxn3rVYHPkZkk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>栾树</span></p><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBZbmI9SdmNyhkklngHqbvVYCiaaHyXJDHqLibdp285646NY72Ot5HpKTaqMoI7NhJ9Xjh11H03YziaslOicCGILZkZ8YRuErddxeI/640?from=appmsg\"/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span>草坪上的落叶</span></p></section></section><p><span>最显眼的，就是华农洪泽湖湖畔的大花紫薇。斜倚向水面的枝叶，不知何时已然金黄，在阳光下</span><span>更加引人注目。而不少植物的“变装”，要细心观察才能发现：树木园里的落羽杉部分叶尖开始泛红，零零散散地挂在枝头；第五教学楼旁的铁冬青，结出不少红褐色的小果；校友花园里的柚木叶片，也悄悄换了红色；校园各处学院楼的台阶上，不时看见落叶的身影……它们像一封封寄出的秋冬“请柬”，恰到好处地透出换季的讯息。</span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDLBm4FoObXWJBglWr3icbZUUI6micRblLwtg9lNI9sGLibTeJHdcpFuB6LwGHlQPzQwAmupINia9viaicniaCTpGaO6MRqpny0uUktMw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCmMgU3A2RNzibuflYyWKomXs4AzUl41e7zRBlPxibviaH8df08iaIfFplSx9lZ5ibUUnEs8A0NoReicRibEsMQMH7c4TJuc8Kkff2klc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBiboKCb4iavpYvm32dTaVrcQCtxjQJgl3DVBuQnB3CDon8Pp40ArhtQRUkibfjVdYpib5e0L3JgxGpjKyXEmyYokxgNX9cfMfBazM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>丹桂</span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAOIUXtPDibpiaFu60h0vG8DarP2gNj8mawgbyMrKgtWCibpHsrGrO9Rn1VblGndqax9Jx9rGcAHGu6zKt6iabFxFxicqZee2NMx7WM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAz28HN0MPtUQTK8C0S0TlMicKO4eX90pP6r4DKw0oOlGVicWVok3ds6j1kibkZsGxmoq1LuFpjDOY7o5g7e2iazxlXhq31H3MbFjQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCMaS1tnhLLo9HSqeYBnuIvNZD3qZcicrDGeoE1HegIZd20IUEcUiaLSnibGPgLPAtSlY9hnUDQgM7Xl5C4q1V76zGHxicWQ4iamZ20/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span>四季桂</span></section><p><span><span>“有木名丹桂，四时香馥馥。花团夜雪明，叶剪春云绿。”白居易笔下的丹桂，在5号楼前的桂花园中悄然吐露芬芳。丹桂一年仅有几天珍贵花期，今年恰逢小雪时节绽放。</span></span></p><p><span><span>“相比红花羊蹄甲和美丽异木棉的满树盛开，我更爱桂花的内敛与低调。”林学与风景园林学院教授吴永彬介绍，如今的华农校园，几乎到处都种有桂花，但在平时，它们的树形、叶色都很普通，以至于让人容易忽略它们的存在。“就算开花时，桂花小小的花朵也是躲在叶底下静悄悄地开，只是那迷人的甜香，最终暴露了它们的身影。”吴永彬笑道。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckB1JUC4lsUjchraAsbVEFiaRRibsdiaXfzBFYuwlMcozIibic84TicmRMpYYLqzqiaTbD0DbQBZfFibOztGHlia01lviaCksoiaBX4bqkkN3M/640?from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCBUQ3BSAurly0KEpeptc9lIKDQg2jvMrEFPRs7mmrPz4rEvYvbUuXsAteMTRlc1jjkWAgJjgs3X6BHLy5hKTW2MjhopDiaeXK4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCkzP5axV1QcKsV0ANptictvFNDEPZL84XlsWBIITQB0b6sfpYticiaWYybwO3dGqlNAQp1XQCgeel9sSpU79zu5TNkgAshByD7oc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAblw0jrTRwU7ysvYPwgzBNeIpxzXDqufZfw6ic62zglQ6N7AJeJibQV83TZtZoiahoxiauw5Yib9sNTzNFjiamIj7YAib3gzBMrZViaok/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span>昭阳湖畔、启林北区的美丽异木棉迎来盛花期</span></p></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBk0gNE22pfy5wcWSHuARib0ftBemOI8oxAMpLm4WribllwJ2xtCPG9icra2LtExxkClLvibib5uaChS6rGicHicEDuRoh1pYD1lHqVF8/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBXNbnnjRQ8jGujHd2NDxIeAEH4Kg9TJdVgJBE24nYRXrQdh3mTOnRQZrmIdMicEQjyNRxWFhbBPic8XDDkQtMA3Fa0P9ba9WSl8/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span>校园各处均有盛开红花羊蹄甲</span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAmIkBd8GqsOupwPrNHibF13g2Oe9eibvwEST7XIibtLJwDX7eIdrAeXH2ROYNwliccvcJXWbAud7PwYkDcQWtj5QYq6mvNk21rMto/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span>三角梅倒映在湖面</span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBcnFbPNccSFNu2dibZbTXqPicbU4FfIhJfDI4Iic6yibFdeYia5h5YT2eo72XnNpLwkFSgeq0h0iabhqibgXUAC2jqVRqYjPokAicQd4w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>菊花</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span>相较阳光灿烂的晴日，雨天的花景更别有一番情调。“立冬至小雪的半个月，广州时常下雨。在下雨伴随着的急速降温的作用下，</span><span>红花羊蹄甲</span><span>娇嫩红艳的落瓣漂在雨水中，倒影成趣，汇成红毯，真让人不忍踏足。”吴永彬分享。</span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_gif/IDUdWG9uScADeriaKXThK0ibT0Hlb99XsrbachMIPya41fxpLWaVzUwAhPCnOXmsXBx3icoibKjZiayleX9TG9e4wCWiaNibmBtAkZo4Az4hBeDPqg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>降温晴日里，烟火暖人心</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDF4PPV4VibxzsXUeY8xWtQwiavwtf0kYu1QEzqlNCpOwkm8fVC8JXiaicSm0P7J2lGURLMEJQk3gJgpJSzo3bqQUg0YmgdUYQCak0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDrWJa8H0TaZicGGATicq6wibYoksooYQccjwjHxO4lcDttsVWmgHSic1XV00shBdknLyMJX2tKAKGUe1UBQGejUCLeYBia2lWRxm6A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBUfQ2ic1tYMjsK3K61mwoj2mDtZvrExWOXr05fib0ibBKPJe20rAoxmas66FVNRLib2R4ul5J1DBHqaBNDg6j1WXxvIrUOibMQola8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBT7y8FmESY5wFE5GVWwQM1g4KNjMJAHppoAOd4ZuO9PlMq9ORtibj9R4Ccpy2fsXzlib2amFvTPp4cn6FUQoADIvRqA6Oteerqk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBDoMWkT0c2Op0n9xru3v2B289ibzeV3efiavEOvnjwdnYsZiahSZJEsUbXB3p4vb5LswMW0ypnzeudfUNs9hMLAicz3JKy12M7pzw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBE0Mh5UB8ejzl0vtjQkWiagkEcMkstUhpyXrCkQnCL5gSelnvqf7URS5aYvLYuTbd736qFuNib3iaO0AzvyN90fVbFfnfWpqzyzU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDwCzgpYHCcFVRSZskYHlEAaMsibqdch4CVGrCjibFcCWCHK7D7dI5qwIUehUQlcK3Jmw3xEIIXY9rEXAfDoh04e3TG5cGwkhcP8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>小雪前后广州气温下降、日照变短，暖阳变得更为珍贵。天气晴好，三两好友结伴，探寻校光影间流淌的别样温柔：路边的狗尾巴草擎着毛茸茸的穗子，</span><span>兽医学院的天台上各色菊花争相盛放，鸟儿嬉闹林间。人们静静感受大自然的美好，把这宁静治愈的时刻，藏进小雪节气的记忆。</span></p><p><span><span>点击视频，吃点暖的！</span></span></p></section><section><p><span>岭南地域气候温润，小雪节气的更迭藏在风物民俗与烟火日常之中。广东人素来有“贴秋膘”的习惯，且饮食讲究应季，华农的食堂便应时更新了秋冬菜单：白萝卜在锅里咕嘟作响，羊肉煲冒着氤氲热气，一碗下肚，暖意从喉咙淌入胃里。</span></p><p><span>“冬腊风腌，蓄以御冬。”北风渐起，小雪时节还是全年绝佳的风干时令——家家户户晾晒腊肠、腊鸭、鱼干，借助自然北风风干锁香，储存冬日风味；配上花椒、大茴、八角、桂皮、丁香等香料，做成腊味年货，也是属于广东人的小雪风情。</span></p></section><section><p><span>风物静，烟火长</span></p><p><span>小雪已至，冬味渐浓</span></p><p><span>在时岁之末感知时令转变</span></p><p><span>愿你吃暖穿好</span></p><p><span>赏遍世间的美好风物</span></p></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBQHiaAQjiaeGpicTeWgo6lGE1oVhlbUpZmlJell2jQM8xcZR5q4DI26khRaCwOQKqZSwvOOE0jNwKuuvtyIM8J7YeHUq4X790now/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><b><span>往期回顾</span></b></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652901655&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=b2bb7f8e01d0729ceb3ab63adafbb157&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDpEUm9ko9V68icib3JtrU9ibAJdo8sictRQaYL5w1qzFZ2ibZPMe417FeNNjIicOoUHMgwAVIiafv8vptcmNtAOHD1EP22tnYXImwTeY/640?from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>/ </span></strong></span><span><span>除了三角梅，华农到底还有多少花在开： | 今日立冬 </span></span><span><strong><span>/</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652902443&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=ae9453f4e121ed38b3ec69d1d0ac05c3&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDteU1HCBbH2NsrfLG1CSU51DFTwfgZWLibs3sCrDpRTuQ00Fia2uxx7lHzjwjBQtvLV08wibJTD0deOAVEBpPXVk2mRKmUuFqV3E/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></sectio